{"seq":3,"slug":"sl-cai-stage","title":"监督学习阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/constitutional-ai/supervised/sl-cai-stage","wordCount":1669,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"监督学习阶段\">监督学习阶段</h1><p>批评产出诊断、修订产出干净回答，但单个样本还不是模型。监督学习阶段（SL-CAI）要做的，是把成千上万次「批评—修订」循环攒成一个数据集，再用它对模型做一次监督微调，得到一个「已经初步无害」的 SL-CAI 模型。这一步是宪法 AI 两阶段流水线的前半程终点，也是后半程 RLAIF 的起点。本篇讲这个组装与训练的整体流程；单步的批评见 <a href=\"self-critique\">自我批评</a>，单步的修订见 <a href=\"revision-process\">修订过程</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>监督学习阶段（SL-CAI）把成千上万次「批评—修订」循环的定稿回答攒成数据集，再用它对模型做一次监督微调——它是两阶段流水线的前半程终点、后半程 RLAIF 的起点。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>训练样本</strong>：一对 (prompt, revised-response)，来自对有害提示跑完整批评—修订循环后的定稿回答。</li>\n<li><strong>数据两股汇入</strong>：无害性样本全部来自自我修订（AI 自产），有用性样本仍来自人类示范的对话。</li>\n<li><strong>先监督再强化的理由</strong>：预训练模型离目标分布还远，直接 RL 探索慢且易发散；先用修订数据 SFT 相当于把模型「搬」到目标附近。</li>\n<li><strong>训练目标</strong>：普通自回归语言建模损失 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>SL</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{SL}} = -\\sum_{t} \\log p_\\theta(y_t \\mid x, y_{&lt;t})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SL</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1308em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；难点在数据而非损失函数。</li>\n<li><strong>固有天花板</strong>：监督微调只能模仿数据集里出现过的回答，无法「超越示范」——故需 RLAIF 用偏好信号继续精调。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话：SL 给出好起点，RL 给出好梯度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据从哪来-红队提示-修订循环\">数据从哪来：红队提示 × 修订循环</h2><p>SL-CAI 的训练数据不是人写的示范，而是模型自产的。起点是一批「有害提示」——即容易引出危险回答的红队提示，来源包括早期人类红队收集的攻击性问题、以及模型自动生成的变体。每个提示都跑一遍完整的批评—修订循环，最终那段修订定稿的回答，连同原提示，构成一条 (prompt, revised-response) 训练样本。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[有害提示池&lt;br/&gt;人类红队 + 自动生成] --&gt; B[初始有用性模型作答]&#10;    B --&gt; C[批评-修订循环 1到4轮]&#10;    C --&gt; D[修订定稿回答]&#10;    D --&gt; E[无害性样本&lt;br/&gt;prompt + revised response]&#10;    F[人类示范的有用性对话] --&gt; G[有用性样本]&#10;    E --&gt; H[混合数据集]&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[监督微调预训练模型]&#10;    I --&gt; J[SL-CAI 模型]\">flowchart TD\n    A[有害提示池&lt;br/&gt;人类红队 + 自动生成] --&gt; B[初始有用性模型作答]\n    B --&gt; C[批评-修订循环 1到4轮]\n    C --&gt; D[修订定稿回答]\n    D --&gt; E[无害性样本&lt;br/&gt;prompt + revised response]\n    F[人类示范的有用性对话] --&gt; G[有用性样本]\n    E --&gt; H[混合数据集]\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[监督微调预训练模型]\n    I --&gt; J[SL-CAI 模型]</pre><p>注意图里有两股数据汇入。无害性样本全部来自自我修订，这是 CAI 的创新点；但有用性样本仍来自人类示范的对话——因为「回答有没有帮到人」这件事还得以人的感受为准。这个「无害靠 AI、有用靠人」的分工贯穿整个宪法 AI，<a href=\"../foundations/why-constitutional-ai\">为何宪法 AI</a> 里已把它作为核心替换讲过，这里落到数据配比上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么要先监督-再强化\">为什么要先监督、再强化</h2><p>一个自然的问题是：既然后面要做 RLAIF，为什么不直接上强化学习，非要先做一遍监督微调？论文给出的理由是分布与稳定性。预训练加有用性微调后的初始模型，其输出分布离「无害且不回避」这个目标还很远；如果直接 RL，策略要从很偏的起点探索，既慢又容易发散。先用修订数据做 SFT，相当于把模型「搬」到接近目标的分布上，让 RL 只需在其附近做精调。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>若跳过 SL 直接 RL</th>\n<th>先做 SL 再 RL</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>策略起点离目标分布远</td>\n<td>起点已接近无害且非回避</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>探索空间大、奖励稀疏</td>\n<td>探索集中在目标附近</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练不稳、易发散</td>\n<td>训练更稳、收敛更快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更易被奖励攻击带偏</td>\n<td>分布约束降低被带偏风险</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这套「先 SFT 把分布拉正、再用 RL 精调」的次序，并非 CAI 独有，而是继承自 RLHF 的标准做法，其原理见 <a href=\"../../rlhf-preference-alignment/foundations/sft-instruction\">SFT 与指令微调</a>。CAI 只是把 SFT 的数据来源从「人写示范」换成了「自我修订」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"微调目标与一个直觉的度量\">微调目标与一个直觉的度量</h2><p>SL-CAI 的训练目标就是普通的自回归语言建模损失：在给定提示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 的条件下，最大化修订回答 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 每个 token 的对数似然，</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mtext>SL</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>t</mi></munder><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L}_{\\text{SL}} = -\\sum_{t} \\log p_\\theta\\big(y_t \\mid x, y_{&lt;t}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">SL</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>没有任何花哨机制——难点从来不在损失函数，而在数据。模型学的是「面对这类有害提示，就该产出这种无害且带解释的回答」这一映射。因为训练数据里的回答都经过多轮修订、显式对抗过回避，模型微调后会把「解释为什么不该做，而不是简单拒绝」这种行为模式内化下来。</p>\n<p>一个衡量 SL-CAI 是否成功的粗略信号，是模型在保持有用性的同时无害性提升了多少——即前一篇提到的联合目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha h + (1-\\alpha)u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 是否整体抬升，而非靠牺牲 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 换 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>。真正把这个平衡量化检验，要到红队与评估环节，见 <a href=\"../practice/red-teaming-cai\">红队与稳健性</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sl-cai-的产物与它的局限\">SL-CAI 的产物与它的局限</h2><p>SL-CAI 微调完成后，得到的模型已经明显更无害、更少回避——但它还不是终点。监督微调有个固有天花板：它只会模仿数据集里出现过的修订回答，无法「超越示范」去主动权衡多个候选哪个更好。要让模型学会在细粒度上比较、并把偏好推向更优，就需要偏好信号和强化学习，这正是 RLAIF 阶段要补的。</p>\n<p>换句话说，SL-CAI 把模型带到了「大致对」的位置，RL-CAI 负责把它推到「更稳、更精」的位置。这个交接点是理解整条流水线的关键：SL 给出好起点，RL 给出好梯度。下一章从「用 AI 反馈代替人类偏好标注」讲起，见 <a href=\"../rlaif/ai-feedback\">AI 反馈替代人类</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SL-CAI 把海量「批评—修订」循环的定稿回答攒成 (提示, 修订回答) 数据集，对预训练模型做监督微调。</li>\n<li>数据两股汇入：无害性样本全来自自我修订（AI），有用性样本仍来自人类示范。</li>\n<li>先监督再强化的理由是分布与稳定：SFT 把模型拉到接近目标的分布，让后续 RL 更稳更快。</li>\n<li>训练目标就是普通自回归似然，难点在数据而非损失；模型内化「解释而非简单拒绝」的模式。</li>\n<li>SL-CAI 只能模仿、无法超越示范，故需 RLAIF 用偏好信号继续精调——SL 给起点，RL 给梯度。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>组成数据的两个原子操作：<a href=\"self-critique\">自我批评</a>、<a href=\"revision-process\">修订过程</a></li>\n<li>无害靠 AI、有用靠人的分工由来：<a href=\"../foundations/why-constitutional-ai\">为何宪法 AI</a></li>\n<li>RL 阶段如何接手 SL 的起点：<a href=\"../rlaif/ai-feedback\">AI 反馈替代人类</a></li>\n<li>先 SFT 再 RL 的通用原理：<a href=\"../../rlhf-preference-alignment/foundations/sft-instruction\">SFT 与指令微调</a></li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>来源：Bai et al., <em>Constitutional AI: Harmlessness from AI Feedback</em>, arXiv:2212.08073，§3 SL-CAI。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"监督学习阶段","id":"监督学习阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"数据从哪来：红队提示 × 修订循环","id":"数据从哪来-红队提示-修订循环"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么要先监督、再强化","id":"为什么要先监督-再强化"},{"level":2,"text":"微调目标与一个直觉的度量","id":"微调目标与一个直觉的度量"},{"level":2,"text":"SL-CAI 的产物与它的局限","id":"sl-cai-的产物与它的局限"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"修订过程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/constitutional-ai/supervised/revision-process"},"next":{"title":"AI 反馈替代人类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/constitutional-ai/rlaif/ai-feedback"}}